</div>
&nbsp;

</div>
<div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo" data-block-id="22">
<div class="mc-column content-media__container">
<div class="content-media-container glb-skeleton-box">
<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2.glbimg.com/BaKMq7hHmYaRwKvim7pCMRolzRQ=/0x0:1019x757/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/y/YNoX3RRhKsvWIavr0v7Q/captura-de-tela-2021-08-10-as-15.24.12.png" sizes="(max-width: 2208px) 648px, 100vw" srcset="https://s2.glbimg.com/8cMM96hjt6JigHpNHH-TnLuAmdE=/0x0:1019x757/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/y/YNoX3RRhKsvWIavr0v7Q/captura-de-tela-2021-08-10-as-15.24.12.png 1000w, https://s2.glbimg.com/BaKMq7hHmYaRwKvim7pCMRolzRQ=/0x0:1019x757/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/y/YNoX3RRhKsvWIavr0v7Q/captura-de-tela-2021-08-10-as-15.24.12.png 984w, https://s2.glbimg.com/N10iMmbsYe_-dc9F74MGZd5xPxg=/0x0:1019x757/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/y/YNoX3RRhKsvWIavr0v7Q/captura-de-tela-2021-08-10-as-15.24.12.png 640w, https://s2.glbimg.com/F3-1_RSKXoSvpUT-AiDws_Kj9cw=/0x0:1019x757/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2021/Y/y/YNoX3RRhKsvWIavr0v7Q/captura-de-tela-2021-08-10-as-15.24.12.png 600w" alt="Le Monde (França) sobre ato militar na Praça dos Três Poderes — Foto: Reprodução" /></figure>
</div>
<p class="content-media__description ">Le Monde (França) sobre ato militar na Praça dos Três Poderes — Foto: Reprodução</p>

