</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="chunk-9nje6">
<div class="mc-column content-text active-extra-styles" data-block-type="raw" data-block-weight="3" data-block-id="23">
<div class="content-intertitle">

<strong>Corrida pela sobrevivência</strong>

</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="chunk-5tgal">
<div class="row medium-uncollapsed content-media content-photo" data-block-type="backstage-photo" data-block-id="24">
<div class=" mc-column  content-media__container">
<div class="content-media-container glb-skeleton-box">
<figure class="content-media-figure"><img class="i-amphtml-fill-content i-amphtml-replaced-content" src="https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/kv5DBrSZmsl-ZJ-qozQCemSbrH4=/0x0:2100x1265/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/T/r/FrsLA7TnelzqNLtREgjg/2024-10-10t010745z-2137922212-mt1usatoday24448447-rtrmadp-3-marie-cook-reacts-to-the-damage-to-her-home-in-the-binks.jpg" sizes="(max-width: 2313px) 648px, 100vw" srcset="https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/dyuMm-5skblc_bKbTdQ4SlZ2ihM=/0x0:2100x1265/1000x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/T/r/FrsLA7TnelzqNLtREgjg/2024-10-10t010745z-2137922212-mt1usatoday24448447-rtrmadp-3-marie-cook-reacts-to-the-damage-to-her-home-in-the-binks.jpg 1000w, https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/kv5DBrSZmsl-ZJ-qozQCemSbrH4=/0x0:2100x1265/984x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/T/r/FrsLA7TnelzqNLtREgjg/2024-10-10t010745z-2137922212-mt1usatoday24448447-rtrmadp-3-marie-cook-reacts-to-the-damage-to-her-home-in-the-binks.jpg 984w, https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/Ms41_7wvQH6rujXZ87f7Ha5UCII=/0x0:2100x1265/640x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/T/r/FrsLA7TnelzqNLtREgjg/2024-10-10t010745z-2137922212-mt1usatoday24448447-rtrmadp-3-marie-cook-reacts-to-the-damage-to-her-home-in-the-binks.jpg 640w, https://s2-g1.glbimg.com/gk1pbJIWLo9irsJ7fekolwU7HJo=/0x0:2100x1265/600x0/smart/filters:strip_icc()/i.s3.glbimg.com/v1/AUTH_59edd422c0c84a879bd37670ae4f538a/internal_photos/bs/2024/T/r/FrsLA7TnelzqNLtREgjg/2024-10-10t010745z-2137922212-mt1usatoday24448447-rtrmadp-3-marie-cook-reacts-to-the-damage-to-her-home-in-the-binks.jpg 600w" alt="Mulher lamenta estragos enquanto furacão Milton se aproximava da Flórida — Foto: Bill Ingram/USA Today via Reuters" /></figure>
